## Reuse-First Rule (Mandatory)

Before creating a new component/hook/usecase/repository, search first in:
- `src/shared/presentation/components/`
- `src/shared/presentation/hooks/`
- `src/shared/domain/` and `src/shared/data/`
- Target feature internals (`domain/`, `data/`, `presentation/`)

Only create new when reuse/adaptation is not viable.

---

## Placement Guide (Short)

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| Business entity / value object | `src/features/{feature}/domain/entities/` |
| Repository contract | `src/features/{feature}/domain/repositories/` |
| Business action (usecase) | `src/features/{feature}/domain/usecases/` |
| API/local data access | `src/features/{feature}/data/datasources/` |
| DTO + mapper | `src/features/{feature}/data/models/` |
| Repository implementation | `src/features/{feature}/data/repositories/` |
| Screen / View | `src/features/{feature}/presentation/screens/` |
| ViewModel hook | `src/features/{feature}/presentation/viewmodels/` |
| Feature-specific component | `src/features/{feature}/presentation/components/` |
| Reusable UI (2+ features) | `src/shared/presentation/components/` |
| Shared entity/contract (2+ features) | `src/shared/domain/` |
| Shared datasource/repository | `src/shared/data/` |
| Shared utility | `src/shared/utils/` |
| DI/composition, navigation, env config | `src/core/` |

